    "title": "flaui-qatouch-upload - Upload FlaUI test results to QA Touch",
    "version": "1.2.0",
    "description": "QA Touch reporter for FlaUI (.NET UI automation via NUnit/MSTest). Auto-creates modules, test cases and test runs from NUnit3 XML or TRX result files. Includes CLI tool (flaui-qatouch-upload)."
  },
