      "recursive": false,
      "hidden": false,
      "description": "Show this help message\nCASE IDS:\nA test tagged with a QA Touch case ID (Reqnroll tag @TR0015 / NUnit [Category(\"TR0015\")])\nis uploaded to that case. Tags are only present in NUnit3 XML results (NunitXml.TestLogger),\nnot in TRX. A title starting with the ID (e.g. TR0015CreateJob) also works, in TRX too.\nTests without an ID are matched by title as before.",
